Dear list,

this adds support for the sensors found on macbook/pro's etc. It
requires applesmc to be loaded and on my mbp c1d I get an amazing 14 (!)
sensors (12 temperature, 2 fans in addition to the 2 coretemps).

Please apply!

Soeren
